# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2026-07-19 — corrections.
#
# (a) Python virtualenvs. These were untracked but NOT ignored: 4.1 GB across
#     .venv/ and a venv copied from another machine. One `git add -A` would
#     have committed them.
.venv/
.venv-*/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# (b) Re-include SOURCE-OF-TRUTH json that the blanket `*.json` rule above
#     swallowed. These are inputs, not generated artifacts, and a fresh clone
#     without them does not run: grammarFillers.ts reads period.grammar.json
#     at generation time, every *.intent.json declares $schema against
#     knowledge.schema.json, and buildQaScenarios.ts reads the QA source.
!src/knowledge/knowledge.schema.json
!src/knowledge/entities/period.grammar.json
!src/knowledge/qa/qa_scenarios.source.json
!src/knowledge/patterns/patterns.candidate.json

# (c) Regression baseline is pass/fail HISTORY, not a build artifact — without
#     it the suite cannot tell a new failure from a known one on a fresh clone.
!v6/training_pipeline/benchmarks/regression_baseline.json
